 "discovery_route": "forward_scan",
 "gt_source": "experiment",
 "rationale_zh": "本次提交新增一组构建开关 ZSTD_EXCLUDE_*_BLOCK_COMPRESSOR（并接入 libzstd.mk），允许在编译时剔除部分块压缩器，同时重写了压缩策略到块压缩器的分派逻辑。这是构建配置层面的变化，直接作用于 stream_round_trip 通过随机参数驱动的各种压缩策略。harness 的构建不定义这些开关，默认仍编入全部压缩器：变更前后都能编译，回放语料的往返校验无新失败，改写后的分派代码被执行。harness 仍然充分，属于显式 configuration 阴性。",
 "rationale_en": "This commit adds build switches ZSTD_EXCLUDE_*_BLOCK_COMPRESSOR (wired into libzstd.mk) that let block compressors be compiled out, and rewrites how compression strategies dispatch to block compressors: a build-configuration change acting directly on the strategies stream_round_trip drives through random parameters. The harness build defines none of the switches, so all compressors are still compiled in by default: it builds before and after, round-trip checks on corpus replay show no new failure, and the rewritten dispatch code runs. The harness stays adequate: explicit configuration negative."
}